---

interface Props {
  label?: string;
}
const { label = "How is this checked?" } = Astro.props;
---

<details class="status-note">
  <summary><span class="i" aria-hidden="true">i</span>{label}</summary>
  <div class="body">
    <p>
      Once a month, an automated check requests the original address of every archived website
      and records whether the server responds. The check runs from a server in the United States.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        A site counts as <strong>online</strong> if the server answers normally, or if it answers
        but refuses automated visitors (for example with a bot-protection page).
      </li>
      <li>
        A site counts as <strong>offline</strong> if the address returns "not found" or a server
        error, if the request times out, or if the domain no longer exists.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h4>How to read the result</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Offline does not necessarily mean gone for good.</strong> Servers can be down
        temporarily, sites move to new addresses, and many Ukrainian sites block visitors from
        abroad, which can look the same as being offline.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Online does not guarantee that the original content is still there.</strong> A
        domain can expire and be taken over, parked or replaced by a different site, and an error
        page can still come with a normal response.
      </li>
      <li>
        Older checks were imported from SUCHO's earlier records and may have followed slightly
        different rules.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Treat the status as a signal, not a verdict. If you know more about a site, please contact
      info at <a href="https://sucho.org">sucho.org</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</details>

<style>
  .status-note {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  summary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  summary:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .i {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.2em;
    height: 1.2em;
    border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .body {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
  }
  .body p,
  .body ul {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .body ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .body h4 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .body > :last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
